<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib29.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Transformers: State-of-the-art natural language processing.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib29.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In </span><em id="bib.bib29.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">EMNLP: System Demonstrations</em><span id="bib.bib29.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, 2020.
</span>
</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib30" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib30.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Zhang et al. (2015)</span></span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib30.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Xiang Zhang, Junbo Zhao, and Yann LeCun.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib30.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Character-level convolutional networks for text classification.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib30.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In </span><em id="bib.bib30.10" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)</em><span id="bib.bib30.11" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, 2015.
</span>
</span>
